 r←Test_IE_007(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ref;code;msg;orig;n1;n2;parms1;parms2
⍝ Test IE with an user-defined callback. Allows just Google but nothing else.
⍝ The page should not change but the user-defined callback is supposed to increase the value of `counter`.
⍝ It would be really nice if we could automate this fully (SendKeys?!)
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If batchFlag
     r←¯1
 :Else

     ⎕←(⎕PW-1)⍴'-'
     ⎕←'This test expects you to search for something via Google but the user-defined'
     ⎕←'callback should prevent you from going anywhere but to Google sites. Please try'
     ⎕←'and when you are sure it works that way then close the window.'
     ⎕←''
     ⎕←'To continue press <enter>'
     {}⍞

     #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
     'Temp'#.⎕NS''
     code←''
     code,←⊂'{r}←n OnBeforeNavigate msg;i;URL;url;self;allowed;⎕IO;⎕ML'
     code,←⊂' ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1'
     code,←⊂' self←⊃msg'
     code,←⊂' n←self.n'
     code,←⊂' url←#.APLTreeUtils.Lowercase URL←2⊃msg'
     code,←⊂' :If r←''about:blank''≢url'
     code,←⊂'     allowed←''http://google'' ''https://google'' ''http://www.google'' ''https://www.google'''
     code,←⊂'     r←∨/allowed{⍺≡(≢⍺)↑⍵}¨⊂url'
     code,←⊂' :EndIf'
     code,←⊂' :If 0=r'
     code,←⊂'     self.Stop'
     code,←⊂'     ⎕←''Go to '',url'
     code,←⊂'     ⎕←''Suppressed by user-defined callback.'''
     code,←⊂' :EndIf'
     #.Temp.⎕FX code

     parms1←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
     parms1.caption←'IE Test Case Number "',(¯3↑↑⎕XSI),'"'
     n1←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create parms1

     parms2←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.CreateParms
     parms2.onBeforeNavigate←'#.Temp.OnBeforeNavigate'
     n2←parms2 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.CreateIE n1.∆Form
     #.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.Navigate n2.IEobject'http://google.com/'

     ⎕DQ n1.∆Form

     →PassesIf 1 ∆PromptForSuccess'Did the Browser control act in the expected way?'

     r←∆OK

 :EndIf

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ n1.∆container.Close ⋄ :EndTrap
 :Trap 0 ⋄ ##.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile n2.∆container.IEobject.∆Filename ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
